      "text": "Lord … hath visited men in so much mercy, 2 Ne. 4:26. O the wisdom of God, his mercy and grace, 2 Ne. 9:8. because of his greatness, and his grace and mercy, 2 Ne. 9:53. Lord saw fit in his infinite mercy to spare them, Mosiah 28:4. full of patience, mercy, and long-suffering, Alma 9:26. I have mercy upon you, through mine Only Begotten, Alma 12:33. he is a merciful Being, even unto salvation, Alma 26:35. God is merciful unto all who believe on his name, Alma 32:22. a perfect, just God, and a merciful God, Alma 42:15. do you let the justice of God, and his mercy … have full sway in your heart, Alma 42:30. with everlasting kindness will I have mercy on thee, 3 Ne. 22:8. Little children … alive in him because of his mercy, Moro. 8:19.",
